; Output: ADPCM.M
; Console: ADPCM.OUT
; PMDMML.MAN §13-2, §5-2, §4-4

#Title ADPCM
#Option /v/c

; Part 9 in the ADPCM variants. The voice table and the sample data are not
; part of the module: they come from the .ADP fixture the PMD trace tests load.
; @n,m,o,p selects repeat and release offsets relative to the voice's
; start/stop, so the driver writes the repeat registers and the release path.
J @0 V255 px0 o4 c96
J @1,8,-8,4 V128 px-64,1 o5 e96
J @0,100,-50,-50 V64 px0,1 o3 g96
